# Rare decay: B+ -> K*+ l+ l- (l = e, mu; 50/50), BTOSLLBALL model.
# Fully charged final state: K*+ -> K pi .

Alias      K*+sig       K*+
Alias      K*-sig       K*-
ChargeConj K*+sig       K*-sig

Decay Upsilon(4S)
0.500  B+sig B-                      VSS;
0.500  B-sig B+                      VSS;
Enddecay

Decay B+sig
0.500  K*+sig e+  e-                 PHOTOS BTOSLLBALL;
0.500  K*+sig mu+ mu-                PHOTOS BTOSLLBALL;
Enddecay
CDecay B-sig

Decay K*+sig
0.5      K+  pi0                        VSS;
0.5      K_S0  pi+                        VSS;
Enddecay
CDecay K*-sig

End
